  m_text: "The game's primary goal is to finish each level as soon as you can while
    dodging obstacles and gathering power-ups. In order to go up the leaderboard,
    players should\_strive for the fastest time. Find keys to open the door and complete
    the levels.\n\nMovement Controls:\nPressing Left Arrow / A = Player Moves Left\nPressing
    Right Arrow / D = Player Moves Right\nPressing Up Arrow / W = \tPlayer  Jumps\nHolding
    Space = Player Attacks\n\nPause Menu:\nEscape Button = Opens the pause menu"
